msgid "Product Image"
msgstr "产品图片"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__name
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__name
msgid ""
"Short description of the image (optional), used for internal identification, "
"e.g. \"Front\", \"Detail\", \"Packaging\"."
msgstr "图片的简短说明（可选），用于内部识别，如「正面」「细节」「包装」。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__sequence
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "排序"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__sequence
msgid ""
"Lower values come first. Display order of the gallery images in the "
"thumbnail list (the main image always stays first)."
msgstr ""
"数值小的排在前面；图库图片在缩略图列表中的展示顺序（主图始终在最前）。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__active
msgid ""
"Uncheck to disable an image without deleting it, so historical material is "
"kept."
msgstr "取消勾选可停用某张图片而不删除，便于保留历史素材。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__note
msgid "Note"
msgstr "备注"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__note
msgid "Additional information about this image."
msgstr "对该图片的补充说明。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__product_tmpl_id
msgid "Product"
msgstr "产品"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_image_gallery__product_tmpl_id
msgid ""
"Product template this image belongs to; images are removed together with the "
"product."
msgstr "该图片所属的产品模板；删除产品时图片行随之级联清理。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_template__image_gallery_ids
msgid "Image Gallery"
msgstr "图片图库"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_template__image_gallery_ids
msgid ""
"Additional images of this product (excluding the main image). The main image "
"image_1920 is managed separately; in the UI the main image comes first and "
"the gallery images follow in sequence order."
msgstr ""
"该产品的补充图片（不含主图）。主图 image_1920 独立管理，"
"前端展示时主图作为第一张，其余图库图片按排序跟在后面。"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_image.field_product_template__image_gallery_count
msgid "Image Count"
msgstr "图片数量"

#. module: product_image
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_image.field_product_template__image_gallery_count
msgid ""
"Number of additional images in the gallery (excluding the product main "
"image)."
msgstr "图库中的补充图片数量（不含产品主图）。"

#. module: product_image
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_image/models/product_image.py:0
msgid ""
"The image name \"%(name)s\" already exists for product \"%(product)s\". Image "
"names must be unique within the same product."
msgstr "图片名称“%(name)s”在产品“%(product)s”中已存在，同一产品内图片名称不可重复。"

